   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi, all<div><br></div><div>Recently I have a project: <a href=\"https://github.com/gaocegege/Processing.R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/gaocegege/Processing.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793343523784000&amp;usg=AOvVaw050T0MbPd9jtJZxrpInUxm\">Processing.R</a>, which is the mode in Processing to allow users to write Processing sketches in R. Processing is written in Java, and the functions&#39; parameters are all float:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#800\">/*<br> * </span><span style=\"color:rgb(150,152,150);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre\"><span style=\"color:#800\">Draws a line (a direct path between two points) to the screen.<br></span></span><font color=\"#880000\" face=\"SFMono-Regular, Consolas, Liberation Mono, Menlo, Courier, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;white-space:pre\"><span style=\"color:#800\"> * @param x1 x-coordinate of the first point<br> * @param y1 y-coordinate of the first point<br> * @param x2 x-coordinate of the second point<br> * @param y2 y-coordinate of the second point<br></span></span></font><span style=\"color:#800\"> */</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><font color=\"#880000\" face=\"SFMono-Regular, Consolas, Liberation Mono, Menlo, Courier, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;white-space:pre\"><span style=\"color:#008\">public</span></span></font></span><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#008\">void</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(121,93,163);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">line</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#008\">float</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(237,106,67);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">x1</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#008\">float</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(237,106,67);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">y1</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#008\">float</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(237,106,67);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">x2</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#008\">float</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(237,106,67);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">y2</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// Draw a line in the canvas.</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br></div><div>There is only double(DoubleVector) in Renjin, no float. To add those functions into R, I have to:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#008\">public</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">void</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> line</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">double</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> x1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">double</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> y1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">double</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> x2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">double</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> y2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">super</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">line</span><span style=\"color:#660\">((</span><span style=\"color:#008\">float</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> posAX</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">float</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> posAY</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">float</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> posBX</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">float</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> posBY</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span></div></code></div><br>Is there some suggestions to add float type in Renjin, or other graceful ways to avoid manual cast?</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks for your time.</div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "mTTV_C0wCAAJ",
