   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Ce Gao,<div>Indeed, Renjin was not correctly handling arguments of type float or float[]. I&#39;ve opened an issue here:</div><div><a href=\"https://github.com/bedatadriven/renjin/issues/319\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/bedatadriven/renjin/issues/319&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793343523787000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3U7q1tU6cd6ABL0p-bzUiq\">https://github.com/bedatadriven/renjin/issues/319</a><br></div><div><br></div><div>And comitted a quick fix. A new release should be available shortly.</div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>ALex</div><div><br></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On Mon, May 29, 2017 at 3:49 AM Ce Gao &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">gaoc...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div></div>"
    ],
