     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Ce Gao,<div>Indeed, Renjin was not correctly handling arguments of type float or float[]. I&#39;ve opened an issue here:</div><div><a href=\"https://github.com/bedatadriven/renjin/issues/319\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/bedatadriven/renjin/issues/319&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793343523790000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0evtxO0uC2n93sJzPxicY3\">https://github.com/bedatadriven/renjin/issues/319</a><br></div><div><br></div><div>And comitted a quick fix. A new release should be available shortly.</div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>ALex</div><div><br></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On Mon, May 29, 2017 at 3:49 AM Ce Gao &lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">gaoc...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi, all<div><br></div><div>Recently I have a project: <a href=\"https://github.com/gaocegege/Processing.R\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/gaocegege/Processing.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793343523790000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2V9DwKejAuPFgMgycPOei4\">Processing.R</a>, which is the mode in Processing to allow users to write Processing sketches in R. Processing is written in Java, and the functions&#39; parameters are all float:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#800\">/*<br> * </span><span style=\"color:rgb(150,152,150);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#800\">Draws a line (a direct path between two points) to the screen.<br></span></span><font color=\"#880000\" face=\"SFMono-Regular, Consolas, Liberation Mono, Menlo, Courier, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#800\"> * @param x1 x-coordinate of the first point<br> * @param y1 y-coordinate of the first point<br> * @param x2 x-coordinate of the second point<br> * @param y2 y-coordinate of the second point<br></span></span></font><span style=\"color:#800\"> */</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><font color=\"#880000\" face=\"SFMono-Regular, Consolas, Liberation Mono, Menlo, Courier, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#008\">public</span></span></font></span><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#008\">void</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(121,93,163);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">line</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#008\">float</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(237,106,67);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">x1</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#008\">float</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(237,106,67);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">y1</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#008\">float</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(237,106,67);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">x2</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#008\">float</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(237,106,67);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">y2</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// Draw a line in the canvas.</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br></div><div>There is only double(DoubleVector) in Renjin, no float. To add those functions into R, I have to:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#008\">public</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">void</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> line</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">double</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> x1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">double</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> y1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">double</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> x2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">double</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> y2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">super</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">line</span><span style=\"color:#660\">((</span><span style=\"color:#008\">float</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> posAX</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">float</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> posAY</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">float</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> posBX</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">float</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> posBY</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span></div></code></div><br>Is there some suggestions to add float type in Renjin, or other graceful ways to avoid manual cast?</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks for your time.</div><div><br></div></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Renjin&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">renjin-dev+...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793343523790000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3avnD-J4W_TGQn0AJceTKm\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<br>\r\n</blockquote></div>\r\n</blockquote></div></div>"
